&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans     &kp BACKSPACE  &trans                                     &zoomIn   &msc SCRL_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_UP    &msc SCRL_UP     &trans     &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &kp LCTRL  &kp ENTER      &trans                                     &zoomOut  &mmv MOVE_LEFT  &mmv MOVE_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_RIGHT  &mkp RCLK  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans     &trans         &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans     &trans    &msc SCRL_LEFT  &mkp MCLK       &msc SCRL_RIGHT  &trans     &trans
                                                  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &mkp LCLK  &trans
