&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans        &kp BACKSPACE  &trans                                     &MACZoomIn   &msc SCRL_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_UP    &msc SCRL_UP     &trans     &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &kp LEFT_ALT  &kp ENTER      &trans                                     &MACZoomOut  &mmv MOVE_LEFT  &mmv MOVE_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_RIGHT  &mkp RCLK  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans        &trans         &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans     &trans       &msc SCRL_LEFT  &mkp MCLK       &msc SCRL_RIGHT  &trans     &trans
                                                     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &mkp LCLK  &trans
            >;

            sensor-bindings = <&Scroll_D_U>, <&Scroll_RL>;
