&trans  &kp C_VOLUME_DOWN  &kp C_VOLUME_UP  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_DEC  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_INC  &kp PRINTSCREEN                                  &kp HOME  &kp ENTER       &kp UP_ARROW    &kp BACKSPACE    &trans      &trans
&trans  &trans             &trans           &kp LCTRL             &kp LEFT_SHIFT        &trans                                           &kp END   &kp LEFT_ARROW  &kp DOWN_ARROW  &kp RIGHT_ARROW  &shift_f10  &trans
&trans  &kp C_MUTE         &trans           &trans                &trans                &trans           &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp SPACE       &trans          &trans           &trans      &trans
                                                                                        &trans           &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
