&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &kp RCTRL  &mkp LCLK  &trans  &trans  &trans  &mmv MOVE_LEFT  &msc SCRL_DOWN  &msc SCRL_UP
